<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35605" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">per-tĕnŭis</span></b> , e,
			adj., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>very thin</i>, <i>very small</i> or
				<i>fine.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sabulum pertenue,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					18, 6, 7, § 34</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, <i>very slight</i> or
				<i>slender</i>, <i>very weak</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">spes salutis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Fam. 14, 3, 2</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">discrimen,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Agr. 2, 32, 87</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">suspicio,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Clu. 60, 168</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">argumentum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Verr. 1, 6, 17</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ars,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					de Or. 1, 23, 107</span></i>
			.</div>
